          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            For anyone burning several cords a year, the Champion 27-Ton strikes the best balance of speed, vertical capability and price, and the Cub Cadet LS 27 is the step up for buyers who want sturdier construction and a dealer nearby. Fire pit and fireplace owners will be happier with a quiet electric like the Boss ES7T20, and occasional users can manage with a manual hydraulic unit.
          </p>
